[
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R13i_isReferringEntity",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS collega un'entità ipertestuale (espressione o passaggio) alla relazione intertestuale in cui è l'entità referente. La proprietà originale ha come domain l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R13 has referring entity: in DeSMòS, it relates a hypertextual entity (expression or passage) to the intertextual relation in which it is the referring entity. The original property has domain the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "_:N348636469c27458e8186f4ec3446c83a"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R13i is referring entity of"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R13i è entità referente di"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:N348636469c27458e8186f4ec3446c83a",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#unionOf": [
      {
        "@list": [
          {
            "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"
          },
          {
            "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"
          },
          {
            "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"
          },
          {
            "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature"
          },
          {
            "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT6_Architext"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT15_IntertextualityInIntertextualityTheories",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories is used to represent relation types derived from theories of intertextuality, including hypertextuality in Gérard Genette's classification."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories è utilizzata per rappresentare tipi di relazione derivati da teorie dell'intertestualità, tra cui l'ipertestualità nella classificazione di Gérard Genette."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "INT15 Intertextuality in Intertextuality Theories"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "INT15 Intertestualità nelle teorie dell'intertestualità"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12_hasReferredToEntity",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS identifica l'entità ipotestuale di una relazione intertestuale: l'intera espressione o, se la relazione è localizzabile, un passaggio specifico dell'ipotesto. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT3_Interrelation e come range l'unione di lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature e intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression o intro:INT21_TextPassage."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it identifies the hypotextual entity of an intertextual relation: the whole expression or, when the relation can be localised, a specific passage of the hypotext. The original property has domain intro:INT3_Interrelation and range the union of lrmoo:F1_Work, crm:E73_Information_Object, intro:INT1_Passage, intro:INT2_ActualizationOfFeature and intro:INT6_Architext. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression or intro:INT21_TextPassage."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R12 ha entità a cui si riferisce"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R12 has referred to entity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "_:N69859e2d3dc746488197ccfd66599050"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R12i_isReferredToEntity"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "_:N69859e2d3dc746488197ccfd66599050",
