      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "informazioni sulla versione"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "version info"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, E29 Design or Procedure fornisce la categoria procedurale entro cui è modellata desmos:LiteraryConstraint, intesa come procedura applicata durante la creazione di un'espressione."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, E29 Design or Procedure provides the procedural category under which desmos:LiteraryConstraint is modelled, as a procedure applied during the creation of an expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "E29 Design or Procedure"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "E29 Progetto o Procedura"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/isConstraintUsedIn",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Questa proprietà collega una costrizione letteraria agli eventi di creazione dell'espressione in cui è stata impiegata come dispositivo generativo; sottoproprietà di crm:P33i_was_used_by. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This property relates a literary constraint to the expression creation events in which it was employed as a generative device; subproperty of crm:P33i_was_used_by. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is constraint used in"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "è costrizione usata in"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/usedConstraint"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#hasTopConcept",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS collega uno schema concettuale ai concetti che ne costituiscono i punti di accesso gerarchici principali. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:ConceptScheme e come range skos:Concept. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:ConceptScheme e come range skos:Concept."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it relates a concept scheme to the concepts that are its main hierarchical entry points. The original property has domain skos:ConceptScheme and range skos:Concept. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:ConceptScheme and range skos:Concept."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "ha concetto principale"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has top concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R17 created: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale all'evento compositivo che l'ha prodotta. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R17 created: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the compositional event that produced it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R17i was created by"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R17i è stata creata da"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraintScheme",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual",
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#ConceptScheme"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Schema concettuale che raccoglie le costrizioni semantiche, che intervengono prioritariamente sul significato del testo."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Concept scheme collecting semantic constraints, which intervene primarily on the signified of the text."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Semantic Constraint Scheme"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Schema delle costrizioni semantiche"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione fonte alle espressioni che ne derivano. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R76 is derivative of: in DeSMòS, it relates a source expression to the expressions derived from it. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R76i ha derivato"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R76i has derivative"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, prov:Agent is used to represent agents to whom entities or declarations are attributed, including authors, editors, collective agents and, where relevant, software systems."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, prov:Agent è utilizzata per rappresentare gli agenti ai quali vengono attribuite entità o dichiarazioni, inclusi autori, curatori, soggetti collettivi e, ove pertinente, sistemi software."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Agent"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Agente"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, INT11 Type of Interrelation is used as a general category for the types that qualify intertextual relations represented through INTRO."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, INT11 Type of Interrelation è utilizzata come categoria generale per i tipi che qualificano le relazioni intertestuali rappresentate attraverso INTRO."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "INT11 Type of Interrelation"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "INT11 Tipo di interrelazione"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E55_Type"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R3i_realises",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R3 is realised in: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale all'opera che realizza. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F1_Work. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F1_Work."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R3 is realised in: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the work it realises. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F1_Work. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F1_Work."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R3i realises"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R3i realizza"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F1_Work"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76_is_derivative_of",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS indica che un'espressione deriva da un'altra espressione assunta come fonte nella sua creazione. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it states that an expression derives from another expression used as a source in its creation. The original property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R76 è derivato di"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R76 is derivative of"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130_shows_features_of"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R76i_has_derivative"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, E7 Activity is referenced as the original domain of P14 carried out by and P33 used specific technique. lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation is declared as its direct subclass, abbreviating the official chain F28 Expression Creation ⊑ E65 Creation ⊑ E7 Activity (LRMoo 1.0; CIDOC CRM 7.1.3)."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, E7 Activity è referenziata come domain originale di P14 carried out by e P33 used specific technique. lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation ne è dichiarata sottoclasse diretta, abbreviando la catena ufficiale F28 Expression Creation ⊑ E65 Creation ⊑ E7 Activity (LRMoo 1.0; CIDOC CRM 7.1.3)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "E7 Activity"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "E7 Attività"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, F3 Manifestation è utilizzata per rappresentare la manifestazione editoriale o digitale che incorpora un'espressione e alla quale sono associate informazioni relative alla pubblicazione e alla collocazione del testo. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P148_has_component, crm:P148i_is_component_of, dcterms:issued, lrmoo:R4_embodies e schema:pagination."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, F3 Manifestation is used to represent the published or digital manifestation embodying an expression and carrying information about its publication and textual location. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P148_has_component, crm:P148i_is_component_of, dcterms:issued, lrmoo:R4_embodies and schema:pagination."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "F3 Manifestation"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "F3 Manifestazione"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Il termine preferito per rappresentare il concetto."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The preferred term for representing the concept."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "etichetta preferita"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "preferred label"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT21_TextPassage",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, INT21 Text Passage è utilizzata per rappresentare una porzione testuale identificabile di un'espressione, in particolare quando è necessario documentare i passaggi coinvolti in una relazione intertestuale. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono intro:R30i_isTextPassageOf e intro:R44_hasWording."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, INT21 Text Passage is used to represent an identifiable textual portion of an expression, particularly when documenting passages involved in an intertextual relation. The properties that can be used with this class are intro:R30i_isTextPassageOf and intro:R44_hasWording."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "INT21 Text Passage"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "INT21 Passaggio Testuale"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT1_Passage"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A note that clarifies the intended meaning of the concept."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Una nota che chiarisce il significato inteso del concetto."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "scope note"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "nota di ambito"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/isRevealedBy",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di revealsConstraint: questa proprietà collega una costrizione letteraria all'evidenza testuale che ne permette l'identificazione. La proprietà ha come domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint e come range desmos:TextualFeature."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of revealsConstraint: this property relates a literary constraint to the textual feature that makes it identifiable. The property has domain desmos:LiteraryConstraint and range desmos:TextualFeature."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is revealed by"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "è rivelata da"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/revealsConstraint"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33_used_specific_technique",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione alla costrizione letteraria impiegata come procedura compositiva. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E7_Activity e come range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the literary constraint employed as a compositional procedure. The original property has domain crm:E7_Activity and range crm:E29_Design_or_Procedure. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "P33 ha usato la tecnica specifica"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P33 used specific technique"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E29_Design_or_Procedure"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P33i_was_used_by"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/vocab/vann/preferredNamespacePrefix",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The preferred namespace prefix to use when using terms from the vocabulary in an XML document."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Il prefisso preferito da usare per i termini del vocabolario."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/vocab/vann/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "preferred namespace prefix"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "prefisso preferito del namespace"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/constrainsSemanticUnit",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Questa proprietà collega una costrizione semantica all’unità semantica su cui opera (ad es. personaggio, spazio o tempo). La proprietà ha come domain desmos:SemanticConstraint e come range skos:Concept."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This property relates a semantic constraint to the semantic unit on which it operates (e.g., character, space, or time). The property has domain desmos:SemanticConstraint and range skos:Concept."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "constrains semantic unit"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "vincola unità semantica"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di P67 refers to: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione testuale alle dichiarazioni che vi fanno riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity e come range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of P67 refers to: in DeSMòS, it relates a textual expression to the declarations referring to it. The original property has domain crm:E1_CRM_Entity and range crm:E89_Propositional_Object. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range crm:E33_Linguistic_Object."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P67i is referred to by"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "P67i è riferito da"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrower",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di skos:broader: in DeSMòS collega un concetto a un concetto più specifico entro gli schemi controllati dell'ontologia. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of skos:broader: in DeSMòS, it relates a concept to a more specific concept within the ontology's controlled schemes. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "narrower"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "più specifico"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasAttributedTo",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS attribuisce una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) relativa a una costrizione all'agente che ne è responsabile. La proprietà originale ha come domain prov:Entity e come range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range crm:E39_Actor (anche prov:Agent)."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it attributes a declaration (linguistic object) about a constraint to the agent responsible for it. The original property has domain prov:Entity and range prov:Agent. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range crm:E39_Actor (also prov:Agent)."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "was attributed to"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "è stato attribuito a"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Agent"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A constraint that operates primarily at the level of the signifier. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower and skos:related."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Costrizione che interviene prioritariamente sul significante. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:broader, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme, skos:narrower e skos:related."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Costrizione formale"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Formal constraint"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/SemanticConstraint"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129_is_about",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS indica che una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) ha come argomento una costrizione letteraria. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it states that a declaration (linguistic object) has a literary constraint as its subject. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P129 is about"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "P129 verte su"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P129i_is_subject_of"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty",
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#SymmetricProperty",
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS allinea un concetto DeSMòS a un concetto esterno semanticamente equivalente. La proprietà originale ha come domain skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation) e come range skos:Concept (ereditato da skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range skos:Concept."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it aligns a DeSMòS concept with a semantically equivalent external concept. The original property has domain skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation) and range skos:Concept (inherited from skos:semanticRelation). In DeSMòS, the same property has domain skos:Concept and range skos:Concept."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "corrispondenza esatta"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "exact match"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://schema.org/pagination",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, schema:pagination è utilizzata per registrare la pagina o l'intervallo di pagine di una F3_Manifestation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, schema:pagination is used to record the page or page range of a F3_Manifestation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://schema.org/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "pagination"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "paginazione"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/hasFeature",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Questa proprietà collega un'espressione testuale all'evidenza testuale osservabile di una costrizione. La proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range desmos:TextualFeature."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This property relates a textual expression to an observable textual feature of a constraint. The property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range desmos:TextualFeature."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "ha caratteristica"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has feature"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/TextualFeature"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P130i_features_are_also_found_on",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS collega un'espressione assunta come fonte alle espressioni che ne presentano tratti senza derivarne il contenuto. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E70_Thing e come range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F2_Expression e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of P130 shows features of: in DeSMòS, it relates an expression used as a source to the expressions showing its features without deriving its content. The original property has domain crm:E70_Thing and range crm:E70_Thing. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F2_Expression and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "P130i caratteristiche si ritrovano anche in"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P130i features are also found on"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E70_Thing"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/hasVersion",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A related resource that is a version, edition, or adaptation of the described resource."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Una risorsa correlata che è una versione, edizione o adattamento della risorsa descritta."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "ha versione"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "has version"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#R19i_isTypeOf",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R19 has type: in DeSMòS collega un tipo di relazione alle relazioni intertestuali che qualifica. La proprietà originale ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation e come range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R19 has type: in DeSMòS, it relates a relation type to the intertextual relations it qualifies. The original property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT3_Interrelation. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain intro:INT11_TypeOfInterrelation and range intro:INT31_IntertextualRelation."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT11_TypeOfInterrelation"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R19i is type of"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R19i è tipo di"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT3_Interrelation"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4_embodies",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS collega una manifestazione editoriale o digitale all'espressione che incorpora. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it relates a published or digital manifestation to the expression it embodies. The original property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F3_Manifestation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F3_Manifestation"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R4 embodies"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R4 incarna"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R4i_is_embodied_in"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R15i_is_fragment_of",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Inversa di R15 has fragment: in DeSMòS collega una dichiarazione peritestuale all'espressione di cui è frammento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E90_Symbolic_Object e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Inverse of R15 has fragment: in DeSMòS, it relates a peritextual declaration to the expression of which it is a fragment. The original property has domain crm:E90_Symbolic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E90_Symbolic_Object"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R15i is fragment of"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R15i è frammento di"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67_refers_to",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS collega una dichiarazione (oggetto linguistico) all'espressione testuale a cui fa riferimento. La proprietà originale ha come domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object e come range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it relates a declaration (linguistic object) to the textual expression it refers to. The original property has domain crm:E89_Propositional_Object and range crm:E1_CRM_Entity. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain crm:E33_Linguistic_Object and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E89_Propositional_Object"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "P67 refers to"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "P67 si riferisce a"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E1_CRM_Entity"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P67i_is_referred_to_by"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/VisualConstraint",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Constraint that intervenes on the visual or typographic arrangement of the text, where the spatial layout of letters/words on the page is itself part of the rule. The properties that can be used with this class are desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme and skos:related."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Costrizione che interviene sulla disposizione visiva o tipografica del testo, in cui l'impaginazione spaziale di lettere/parole sulla pagina è essa stessa parte della regola. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono desmos:constrainsFormalUnit, desmos:constraintOrigin, desmos:involvesOperation, skos:closeMatch, skos:inScheme e skos:related."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Costrizione visiva"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Visual constraint"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/FormalConstraint"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/license",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A legal document giving official permission to do something with the resource."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Il documento legale che stabilisce i permessi di utilizzo della risorsa."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "license"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "licenza"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/isOriginOf",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Questa proprietà collega un concetto di origine (tradizione o invenzione ex novo) alle costrizioni letterarie che qualifica. La proprietà ha come domain skos:Concept e come range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "This property relates an origin concept (tradition or brand-new invention) to the literary constraints it qualifies. The property has domain skos:Concept and range desmos:LiteraryConstraint."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is origin of"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "è origine di"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "https://w3id.org/desmos/LiteraryConstraint"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation è utilizzata per rappresentare l'evento compositivo che produce un'espressione testuale e nel quale può essere impiegata una costrizione letteraria. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint e lrmoo:R17_created."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, F28 Expression Creation is used to represent the compositional event that produces a textual expression and in which a literary constraint may be employed. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P14_carried_out_by, dcterms:created, desmos:usedConstraint and lrmoo:R17_created."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "F28 Expression Creation"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "F28 Creazione dell'espressione"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E7_Activity"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#Entity",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, prov:Entity è utilizzata come categoria di provenienza per gli oggetti linguistici di cui viene documentata l'attribuzione a un agente, in particolare le dichiarazioni relative alle costrizioni letterarie."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, prov:Entity is used as a provenance category for linguistic objects whose attribution to an agent is documented, particularly declarations concerning literary constraints."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Entity"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Entità"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#DatatypeProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, dcterms:created è utilizzata per registrare la data associata all'evento di creazione di un'espressione."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, dcterms:created is used to record the date associated with an expression creation event."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "created"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "creato"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Literal"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17_created",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS collega un evento di creazione dell'espressione all'espressione testuale che produce. La proprietà originale ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS la stessa proprietà ha come domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation e come range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In DeSMòS, it relates an expression creation event to the textual expression it produces. The original property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression. In DeSMòS, the same property has domain lrmoo:F28_Expression_Creation and range lrmoo:F2_Expression."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F28_Expression_Creation"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "R17 created"
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "R17 ha creato"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf": [
      {
        "@id": "http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/R17i_was_created_by"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AnnotationProperty"
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A bibliographic reference for the resource."
      },
      {
        "@language": "it",
        "@value": "Il riferimento bibliografico con cui citare la risorsa."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "http://purl.org/dc/terms/"
      }
